# Feedback can enchant its own caster's enchantment, and then damages that player at their upkeep (CR 702.5a, 303.4). The
# trigger reads the enchanted enchantment's controller as each upkeep begins (CR 603.2): once Harmless Offering gives the
# Crusade to Bot2, Feedback (still Bot1's) triggers at Bot2's upkeep and deals the 1 damage to Bot2, and no longer at Bot1's.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Crusade
Feedback
Harmless Offering
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
